<p>Still gonna novote. I liked it, but not enough to upvote. With the MTF log, I didn't feel creeped out, but rather thoroughly disgusted by the body horror. While this is normally good for an article, for a <em>Department of Abnormalities</em> article, I feel as though it throws away the original theme and tries to become its own thing.</p>
<p>However, I can't downvote. You did successfully execute the body horror, and the article was certainly an interesting read. <span style="text-decoration: line-through;">Also I want my DoA logo to be canon.</span></p>
<p>That being said, good luck in the contest!</p>
<p><strong>Edit:</strong> After further consideration, I've decided to downvote. This is essentially the anti-thesis of a DoA article, and would work infinitely better if it had DoA's name removed from it. <span style="text-decoration: line-through;">Also I don't care about the logo anymore.</span></p>

